[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: System Requirements
PREFIX: SYS-
OPTIONS:
  ENABLE_MID: True

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-1
TITLE: Map-based station browsing
STATEMENT: >>>
The device shall display an interactive world map that the user can pan and zoom to browse by location.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-2
TITLE: Location-based streaming
STATEMENT: >>>
The device shall let the user select a location on the map and begin streaming a live internet radio station associated with that location.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-3
TITLE: Self-contained audio output
STATEMENT: >>>
The device shall play audio through built-in stereo speakers, without requiring an external speaker or a paired device.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-4
TITLE: Standalone operation
STATEMENT: >>>
The device shall function as a standalone appliance, with no companion app or outside service required for basic listening.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-5
TITLE: Wireless Connectivity
STATEMENT: >>>
The device shall connect to the internet over Wifi to stream audio. The user shall be able to input Wifi credentials.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SYS-6
TITLE: Power
STATEMENT: >>>
The device shall plug into mains power and perform all necessary power conversions internally.
<<<